        "@value": "Section 121a of the Code is amended by substituting for the words “with death and shall also be liable to fine” the words “with death or imprisonment for a term of not less than thirty years but not exceeding forty years and if not sentenced to death, shall also be punished with whipping of not less than twelve strokes”. Amendment of section 121b"
